<description>&lt;p&gt;Rebel forces clashed with government troops near the Uganda border, killing one and wounding three. In Tonj East, community leaders were detained and peace talks were launched to stop deadly communal violence, while Sudanese gunmen killed three South Sudanese refugees and injured seven, and a chief was injured in a land dispute in Juba. A UN envoy urged South Sudanese leaders to choose consensus over confrontation, and a documentary on local peacemaking was screened. Joseph Lagu, a South Sudan independence figure, died at age 94. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQc3d0SGg2QnRBdkZyNTNFVExOVmsxN09PVEpleEZHek0taWVpYVc0VDZlcUx2cmtPMURpSzRXb0dSbTRQUmIzMmt3dXdfZXN2RHZvZ050bUNMNmhUc21MREF0NUx2eFF1MDQ5SlJIb3JfaDdUbmRJMlBJVlBidG1ueHVoOUlkakJ3WmFza2M1X0paM0lObDEtdXZHaFV1bFBIRlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Tamazuj&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPcUlCZzJFdzBSRXpud2FDSnB0ZWJwTEJENVEtSFN0WFZQQ2FrVHo2Y2c4ejhSYWpXemJrTExMcE5IbWZsYlNNeklvTHd6UGtFWWp0alpUOGwzY1lWbFlhMUwtQkFOaW5uS1NuTGNiUWdZZWM2Z2IwVG1qMzRhVnFKVUhDZE42VGwxOUpDVGNOenlZUkV1MWlYTEJXWFBucmdBWEFTVk9qSzBxSE5BVms4dXRRSC1CcjlQUGlqYnJBQzd5ZEt3RG8tSg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOWWpSV0ZhMTZNM2NLZWk5d1NjV0h1b1dkdTBsclR2X2pVY0hyNWJOcFN1dGlhWmhyd2Y5UTNKU0s0LXVJSmZNMXZwMWRNZEtmU1h5M1Y4S3RtQjBzVm5ZUExURnFPWEQ2UjB6TTRxbjB5NEthaGppS1VWSTB0aXNpYnFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;NTV Uganda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOV3ItRHNWY0x2Snh6OGliQmY3bUNIMWVjajB6WkktcllJWnF2M1ZaRmFJN0staEhqbnBjMFA5QjRYcjBUZ3VCaFRwZ0xjUEpmdzZ1dUFsbXlVdmlDYUE0dktHNXM2ZnFoQm44QlF5MEs2NXdabmRKZkFKNjNzWXhnVnREM3UyQ3pfOExudEJmWDZIWHBfaTNUM3cwUFJRU2N2V